+# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+"""Flash-Next Qwen vision tower on the shared Hibana image interface.
+
+Prototype: the weight layout matches the Transformers Qwen3.5 vision module.
+Decoder M-RoPE integration is required before this can be enabled in a server.
